name issue_84_encoder_qp_360p_low_rate
describe 360p camera on a 400 kbps link: the encoder model's QP sits between the H.264 thresholds, where libwebrtc's QualityScaler keeps the resolution
duration 30s
video_size 640x360
at 0s capacity=400kbps delay=30ms queue=300ms
# Issue #84 step 1: the encoder QP model (testbench/encoder_model.h) that both
# stacks of sm_compare share. Neither stack adapts resolution yet, so this
# pins the input a quality scaler would see: 720p at the rate this link leaves
# for video is above 37 (QualityScaler adapts down); the same link at 360p
# (this scenario) is inside 24..37 (it stays).
expect video.qp_mean > 24
expect video.qp_mean <= 37
